[2026-03-21T15:38:13Z] [CLAUDE] It's already set to `1`, which means it prefetches 1 extra task beyond the current one. That explains seeing 2 tasks on RunPod — one executing, one prefetched. The third is on the local worker.

This is actually fine behavior. The prefetched task will run as soon as the current one finishes. Nothing is wrong here.
