## Changes Made

### 1. Database Model (`database/models/simulation.py`)
- Added `actual_engine` column (`String(255), nullable=True`) — only populated when the engine falls back to a different algorithm

### 2. Alembic Migration (`alembic/versions/080_add_actual_engine_to_simulations.py`)
