## Key Notes

- **gluonts conflict**: `uni2ts` needs `gluonts~=0.14.3` while `autogluon-timeseries` needs `>=0.15`. They cannot coexist. The `[tool.uv] conflicts` declaration handles this — use either `--extra autogluon` or `--extra moirai`, not both.
