- **No running simulations affected** — all changes are additive (new enum value, new registry entry, new dependency extra). The engine already had a graceful fallback to `StatisticalEngine` when `uni2ts` isn't installed.
- **To install**: `uv sync --extra ml --extra moirai` (omit `--extra autogluon`)
- **Docker**: The Dockerfile currently installs `--extra autogluon`, so Moirai-2 won't be available in the default Docker image. For a Moirai-2 worker, build with `--extra moirai` instead of `--extra autogluon`.
