[2026-03-24T12:38:57Z] [USER] Why is the directory models/huggingface empty on the runpod instance. The start script has this: export HF_HUB_CACHE=/models/huggingface
[2026-03-24T12:39:13Z] [CLAUDE] Good — the `Tabs` root already uses `flex flex-col`, and in the page it gets `className="flex-1 flex flex-col gap-0"`. The chain is:

1. Outer container: `h-full overflow-hidden` 
2. Detail pane wrapper: `flex-1 flex flex-col min-h-0`
3. Tabs: `flex-1 flex flex-col` (from page className override)
4. TabsContent: `flex-1 min-h-0` (now fixed) + `overflow-y-auto` (from page)

The `min-h-0` on `TabsContent` allows it to shrink below its content size, enabling `overflow-y-auto` to kick in. Without it, the flex item defaults to `min-height: auto` which prevents scrolling.

The detail section should now scroll vertically. The fix was adding `min-h-0` to the `TabsContent` component so the flex child can shrink and allow `overflow-y-auto` to work.
