[2026-03-24T14:35:39Z] [USER] How do I manually sync the generate finetuning file?
[2026-03-24T14:35:51Z] [CLAUDE] From the RunPod instance:

```bash
rsync -az --delete -e "ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=accept-new" \
  models/finetune/timesfm/ \
  rune@gorm.predictioninstitute.com:/home/rune/workspace/projects/gorm.ai/models/finetune/timesfm/
```

Or if rsync isn't installed, use scp:

```bash
scp -r models/finetune/timesfm/ \
  rune@gorm.predictioninstitute.com:/home/rune/workspace/projects/gorm.ai/models/finetune/timesfm/
```

This is the same target path from the `finetune_sync_target` in your docker-compose.runpod.yml, just for the timesfm engine specifically.
