[2026-03-30T13:05:29Z] [CLAUDE] Done. The Seasonality section now shows a line chart of the 52-week seasonal profile when yearly seasonality is detected. The chart shows the seasonal effect (positive = above average, negative = below average) across the year with month labels on the x-axis and a zero reference line. This lets users see exactly *when* the seasonal peaks and dips occur.
