<table><thead><tr><th>Zone ID</th><th>Jan 2025</th><th>Feb 2025</th><th>Mar 2025</th><th>Apr 2025</th><th>May 2025</th><th>Jun 2025</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong class="font-semibold">0</strong></td><td>48,630</td><td>42,775</td><td>50,027</td><td>45,288</td><td>45,801</td><td>45,463</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p class="my-1"><strong class="font-semibold">Key Findings:</strong></p>
<ul class="my-1 pl-5 list-disc">
<li class="my-0.5">All active outlets are classified under <strong class="font-semibold">zone_id "0"</strong> (2,894 outlets with zone_id metadata)</li>
