p.\",\"addConfirmButton\":\"Add\",\"freeAddConfirmTitle\":\"Add outlets to group?\",\"freeAddConfirmDescription\":\"Add {count} outlet(s) by ID to this group.\",\"freeAddConfirmButton\":\"Add All\",\"freeRemoveConfirmTitle\":\"Remove outlets from group?\",\"freeRemoveConfirmDescription\":\"Remove {count} outlet(s) by ID from this group.\",\"freeRemoveConfirmButton\":\"Remove All\",\"outletNotFound\":\"Outlet \\"{id}\\" not found\",\"outletsNotFound\":\"{count} outlet(s) not found: {ids}\",\"deleteButton\":\"Delete Group\",\"deleteZoneDescription\":\"Permanently delete this group. Outlets will not be deleted.\",\"deleteAbsoluteTitle\":\"Are you absolutely sure?\",\"deleteAbsoluteDescription\":\"This action cannot be undone. This will permanently delete group \\"{name}\\".\",\"deleteUnderstand\":\"I understand that this will permanently delete this group.\",\"deleteTypeToConfirm\":\"Type \\"delete\\" to confirm\",\"deleteTypePlaceholder\":\"delete\",\"deleteConfirm\":\"Delete\",\"deleteCancel\":\"Cancel\",\"bulkDeleteTitle\":\"Delete {count} groups\",\"bulkDeleteDescription\":\"You are about to delete {count} groups. Outlets will not be deleted.\",\"bulkDeleteUnderstand\":\"I understand that this will permanently delete the selected groups.\",\"bulkDeleteConfirm\":\"Delete {count} groups\",\"toastCreated\":\"Group \\"{name}\\" created\",\"toastCreateError\":\"Failed to create group\",\"toastCopied\":\"Copied to clipboard\",\"toastUpdated\":\"Group \\"{name}\\" saved\",\"toastUpdateError\":\"Failed to save group\",\"toastDeleted\":\"Group deleted\",\"toastDeleteError\":\"Failed to delete group\",\"toastOutletAdded\":\"Outlet added to group\",\"toastOutletAddError\":\"Failed to add outlet(s)\",\"toastBulkAdded\":\"{count} outlet(s) added\",\"toastBulkDuplicates\":\"{count} duplicate(s) skipped\",\"toastOutletRemoved\":\"Outlet removed from group\",\"toastOutletRemoveError\":\"Failed to remove outlet\"},\"configuration\":{\"gormMode\":\"Gorm Configuration\",\"customerMode\":\"{name} Configuration\",\"tabDetails\":\"Details\",\"tabCore\":\"Core\",\"tabWeekday\":\"Weekday Handling\",\"tabInsights\":\"Insights\",\"fieldInsightsSystemPrompt\":\"System Prompt\",\"fieldInsightsSystemPromptInfo\":\"Custom instructions for the AI assistant. Defines how it should behave, what tone to use, and any special context about this customer's data. Leave empty to use the default prompt.\",\"fieldInsightsSystemPromptPlaceholder\":\"You are a sales analytics assistant for Gorm AI...\",\"fieldInsightsHiddenPrompt\":\"Hidden Prompt\",\"fieldInsightsHiddenPromptInfo\":\"Additional instructions injected into the system prompt but not visible to end users. Use this for internal context, data caveats, or business rules the AI should follow silently.\",\"fieldInsightsHiddenPromptPlaceholder\":\"e.g. This customer uses 'sold' to mean net copies sold after returns...\",\"fieldInsightsPredictionEngine\":\"Prediction Engine\",\"fieldInsightsPredictionEngineInfo\":\"The prediction engine used when the AI assistant runs forecasts. Choose a lighter engine for faster responses.\",\"fieldInsightsPredictionStrategy\":\"Prediction Strategy\",\"fieldInsightsPredictionStrategyInfo\":\"The prediction strategy applied to insight forecasts. Controls delivery optimization, return targets, and adjustments.\",\"fieldInsightsWorker\":\"Worker\",\"fieldInsightsWorkerInfo\":\"The Celery worker queue for insight predictions. Use a dedicated worker to avoid blocking production prediction jobs.\",\"fieldInsightsDefault\":\"Use customer default\",\"fieldCustomerId\":\"Customer ID\",\"fieldName\":\"Name\",\"fieldDescription\":\"Description\",\"fieldNotes\":\"Notes\",\"fieldProductionGroup\":\"Production Outlet Group\",\"fieldProductionGroupInfo\":\"The outlet group used for production runs. When set, predictions and simulations default to outlets in this group.\",\"fieldPredictionEngine\":\"Prediction Engine\",\"fieldPredictionEngineInfo\":\"The default prediction engine used when no strategy-specific override is set.\",\"fieldMinimum\":\"Minimum Quantity\",\"fieldMinimumInfo\":\"The minimum delivery quantity per outlet. Predicted values below this threshold are raised to the minimum.\",\"fieldCostPerUnit\":\"Cost per Unit\",\"fieldCostPerUnitInfo\":\"Default cost per unit, used for economic optimal calculation when no outlet-level cost is set.\",\"fieldProfitPerUnit\":\"Profit per Unit\",\"fieldProfitPerUnitInfo\":\"Default profit per unit, used for economic optimal calculation when no outlet-level profit is set.\",\"fieldCurrency\":\"Currency\",\"fieldCurrencyInfo\":\"The currency used for displaying financial values and calculations.\",\"fieldCurrencySearch\":\"Search currencies...\",\"fieldCurrencyNone\":\"No currency\",\"fieldRounding\":\"Delivery Quantity Rounding\",\"fieldRoundingInfo\":\"Method used to round the economic optimal value to a whole delivery quantity.\",\"roundingRound\":\"Round (standard)\",\"roundingCeil\":\"Ceil (round up)\",\"roundingFloor\":\"Floor (round down)\",\"fieldEngineNone\":\"No engine\",\"fieldGroupNone\":\"No group\",\"weekdayCorrectionMon\":\"Auto-correct Monday\",\"weekdayCorrectionTue\":\"Auto-correct Tuesday\",\"weekdayCorrectionWed\":\"Auto-correct Wednesday\",\"weekdayCorrectionThu\":\"Auto-correct Thursday\",\"weekdayCorrectionFri\":\"Auto-correct Friday\",\"weekdayCorrectionSat\":\"Auto-correct Saturday\",\"weekdayCorrectionSun\":\"Auto-correct Sunday\",\"weekdayCorrectionInfo\":\"When enabled, the prediction for this weekday is automatically adjusted using historical weekday patterns to account for systematic day-of-week effects.\",\"weekdayOnlyMon\":\"Isolate Monday\",\"weekdayOnlyTue\":\"Isolate Tuesday\",\"weekdayOnlyWed\":\"Isolate Wednesday\",\"weekdayOnlyThu\":\"Isolate Thursday\",\"weekdayOnlyFri\":\"Isolate Friday\",\"weekdayOnlySat\":\"Isolate Saturday\",\"weekdayOnlySun\":\"Isolate Sunday\",\"weekdayOnlyInfo\":\"When enabled, predictions for this weekday are trained using only historical data from the same weekday, rather than the full time series.\",\"weekdayProfileCorrection\":\"Weekday Profile Correction\",\"weekdayProfileCorrectionInfo\":\"Applies a weekday profile correction that scales predictions based on the typical sales distribution across days of the week.\",\"weekdayProfileCorrectionStrength\":\"Correction Strength\",\"weekdayProfileCorrectionStrengthInfo\":\"Blending factor from 0.0 (no correction) to 1.0 (full correction). Lower values apply a softer adjustment.\",\"weekdayProfileCorrectionThreshold\":\"Correction Threshold\",\"weekdayProfileCorrectionThresholdInfo\":\"Minimum share divergence required before a weekday is corrected. E.g. 0.2 means only weekdays where the forecast profile differs by more than 20% from the historical profile are adjusted.\",\"weekdayProfileCorrectionMethod\":\"Correction Method\",\"weekdayProfileCorrectionMethodInfo\":\"Additive shifts quantiles by the same offset as the point prediction (preserves uncertainty spread). Multiplicative scales all quantiles by the same ratio (can amplify spread on low-volume days).\",\"weekdayProfileCorrectionMethodAdditive\":\"Additive\",\"weekdayProfileCorrectionMethodMultiplicative\":\"Multiplicative\",\"variationAdjustment\":\"Variation Adjustment\",\"variationAdjustmentInfo\":\"Adjusts the economic optimal upward for outlets and weekdays with high sales variation, protecting against stockouts on volatile days.\",\"variationHistoryDays\":\"History Window (days)\",\"variationHistoryDaysInfo\":\"Number of days of historical sales data used to calculate per-weekday variation. Capped to avoid using outdated patterns.\",\"eoMethodology\":\"EO Methodology\",\"eoMethodologyInfo\":\"How the Economic Optimal value is selected from the quantile distribution. Interpolate smoothly estimates between quantile levels. Snap selects the nearest quantile level.\",\"eoMethodologyInterpolate\":\"Interpolate\",\"eoMethodologySnap\":\"Snap to nearest Quantile\",\"eoExtrapolation\":\"EO Extrapolation\",\"eoExtrapolationInfo\":\"Controls how the Economic Optimal handles high-margin products where the critical fractile exceeds P90. E99 extrapolates aggressively, E95 is more conservative, and Cap at E90 uses no extrapolation.\",\"eoExtrapolationE99\":\"Extrapolate to ~E99\",\"eoExtrapolationE95\":\"Conservative (~E95)\",\"eoExtrapolationDampened\":\"Dampened\",\"eoExtrapolationCap\":\"Cap at E90\",\"fallbackEngine\":\"Engine Fallback\",\"fallbackEngineInfo\":\"When enabled, allows the system to fall back to a simpler engine if the configured AI model fails to load (e.g. finetuned to base, base to statistical). When disabled, predictions will fail with an error instead of silently using a different engine.\",\"sectionCorrection\":\"Weekday Correction\",\"sectionCorrectionDesc\":\"Automatically adjust predictions using historical weekday patterns.\",\"sectionIsolation\":\"Weekday Isolation\",\"sectionIsolationDesc\":\"Train predictions using only same-weekday historical data.\",\"sectionOpenDays\":\"Opening Days\",\"sectionOpenDaysDesc\":\"Days on which the publication is open. Closed days are excluded from simulations.\",\"openMonday\":\"Monday\",\"openTuesday\":\"Tuesday\",\"openWednesday\":\"Wednesday\",\"openThursday\":\"Thursday\",\"openFriday\":\"Friday\",\"openSaturday\":\"Saturday\",\"openSunday\":\"Sunday\",\"openDayInfo\":\"When disabled, this day is treated as closed and will be skipped during simulations.\",\"sectionProfile\":\"Profile Correction\",\"tabWorkers\":\"Workers\",\"tabFineTuning\":\"Fine-tuning\",\"fieldFinetunedModelPath\":\"Model Destination Directory\",\"fieldFinetunedModelPathInfo\":\"Directory where the fine-tuned model checkpoint is saved. On RunPod this is typically /models/timesfm_finetuned (mapped to the persistent volume).\",\"fieldFinetuneSyncEvery\":\"Sync Every (outlets)\",\"fieldFinetuneSyncEveryInfo\":\"After this many outlets have been fine-tuned, sync the checkpoint back to the production server. Lower values are safer but incur more transfer costs.\",\"fieldSimultaneousTasks\":\"Simultaneous Tasks\",\"fieldSimultaneousTasksInfo\":\"Number of tasks the worker can run in parallel. Requires a worker restart to take effect. Higher values use more RAM and CPU.\",\"fieldPeriodicCheck\":\"Health Check Interval (minutes)\",\"fieldPeriodicCheckInfo\":\"How often the dashboard checks whether Celery workers are alive.\",\"fieldAutoRestart\":\"Auto-restart Workers\",\"fieldAutoRestartInfo\":\"Automatically restart the Celery worker container when it stops responding.\",\"workerRestartRequired\":\"Worker restart required to apply changes\",\"restartWorkers\":\"Restart Workers\",\"restarting\":\"Restarting...\",\"saveChanges\":\"Save Changes\",\"saving\":\"Saving...\",\"cancelChanges\":\"Cancel\",\"toastCustomerUpdated\":\"Customer details saved\",\"toastCopied\":\"Copied to clipboard\",\"toastConfigUpdated\":\"Configuration saved\",\"toastError\":\"Failed to save configuration\",\"noCustomer\":\"Select a customer to configure\",\"tabAutomatization\":\"Configuration Automatization\",\"optimizeSettingsTitle\":\"Optimize Settings\",\"optimizeSettingsDescription\":\"Run simulations with different configuration combinations to find the most profitable settings for this customer.\",\"optimizeSettingsButton\":\"Estimate Optimal Settings\",\"optimizeModalTitle\":\"Estimate Optimal Settings\",\"optimizeModalDescription\":\"Select which settings to optimize. Each combination will be tested via simulation.\",\"optimizeVariationAdjustment\":\"Variation Adjustment\",\"optimizeEoMethodology\":\"EO Methodology\",\"optimizeEoExtrapolation\":\"EO Extrapolation\",\"optimizeWeekdayProfileCorrection\":\"Weekday Profile Correction\",\"optimizeOptions\":\"{count} options\",\"optimizeSimulationsRequired\":\"{count} simulations required\",\"optimizeEstimatedTime\":\"Estimated time: {time}\",\"optimizeAiModel\":\"AI Model\",\"optimizeAiModelPlaceholder\":\"Select model...\",\"optimizeAiModelAll\":\"Customer default\"