Direction\",\"increasing\":\"Increasing\",\"decreasing\":\"Decreasing\",\"flat\":\"Flat\",\"slopePerWeek\":\"Slope per Week\",\"rSquared\":\"R²\",\"changepoints\":\"Changepoints\",\"changepointsDesc\":\"Significant shifts in the sales trend\",\"noChangepoints\":\"No significant changepoints detected\",\"beforeAfter\":\"Before / After\",\"changePct\":\"Change %\",\"weeklyProfile\":\"Weekly Profile\",\"weeklyProfileDesc\":\"Average sales by day of week across all selected outlets\",\"seasonality\":\"Seasonality\",\"seasonalityDesc\":\"Yearly recurring patterns detected via STL decomposition (requires 2+ years of data)\",\"seasonalityDescPrefix\":\"Yearly recurring patterns detected via\",\"stlDecomposition\":\"STL decomposition\",\"stlTooltip\":\"Seasonal and Trend decomposition using Loess (STL) separates a time series into three components: trend (long-term direction), seasonal (recurring yearly pattern), and residual (noise). This reveals the underlying seasonal shape independent of trend changes.\",\"seasonalityDescSuffix\":\"(requires 2+ years of data)\",\"seasonalityNotEnoughData\":\"Requires at least 2 years of data to detect yearly seasonality\",\"weeklyPattern\":\"Weekly Pattern\",\"weeklyStrength\":\"Strength\",\"yearlyPattern\":\"Yearly Pattern\",\"detected\":\"Detected\",\"notDetected\":\"Not detected\",\"weekdayEffects\":\"Weekday Effects by Outlet\",\"weekdayEffectsDesc\":\"Outlets ranked by how strongly sales vary by day of week\",\"effectStrength\":\"F-Statistic\",\"fStatisticTooltip\":\"The F-Statistic measures how strongly sales vary by day of week. Higher values mean the outlet has a more pronounced weekday pattern (e.g. strong weekday vs weekend difference). Low values indicate relatively uniform sales across all days.\",\"mon\":\"Mon\",\"tue\":\"Tue\",\"wed\":\"Wed\",\"thu\":\"Thu\",\"fri\":\"Fri\",\"sat\":\"Sat\",\"sun\":\"Sun\",\"divergentOutlets\":\"Divergent Trends\",\"divergentOutletsDesc\":\"Outlets whose sales trend differs markedly from th