| TiRex | 35M | No | xLSTM, lightweight |
| FlowState | 18.5M | No | SSM, lightweight |
| AutoGluon (3 variants) | 200M | No | +500MB AutoGluon overhead |

### 3. `ResourceEstimator` service
**`src/gorm_ai/services/resource_estimator.py`** — Three functions:
- `get_system_capacity()` — queries RAM via psutil, GPU VRAM via pynvml or torch.cuda
- `estimate_task()` — resolves engine and returns `MemoryEstimate`
- `check_capacity()` — compares estimate against available resources, returns `CapacityCheck` with `can_run`, `warnings`, and `recommendation`

### 4. Pre-flight capacity checks in task dispatch
Added before `apply_async()` in:
- **`src/gorm_ai/api/routes/predictions.py`** — prediction async endpoint
- **`src/gorm_ai/api/routes/simulations.py`** — simulation async endpoint  
- **`src/gorm_ai/api/routes/prediction_engines.py`** — finetune endpoint

Returns HTTP 422 with details if insufficient resources.

### 5. `POST /api/v1/predictions/estimate` endpoint
**`src/gorm_ai/api/routes/predictions.py`** — New endpoint that accepts engine, task_type, num_outlets, batch_size, horizon, etc. and returns:
- Memory estimate breakdown
- Current system capacity (RAM + GPU)
- `can_run` boolean + warnings + recommendation
