The `allow_fallback` is `False` for this customer (set via `_resolve_fallback_engine`), so instead of silently falling back to the statistical engine, it raises the RuntimeError you're seeing.

**To debug**: look for the warning log line just before the error — it will contain the real reason (OOM, network error, missing weights, etc.). If you don't see it, the log level might be filtering it. Can you search for "Failed to load YingLong" in your logs?

