[2026-04-04T04:50:05Z] [CLAUDE] The file has `
` (LF) line endings in git but the remote machine may be modifying it (e.g., `curl | sh` or the editor on that machine changed it). But more likely — you edited the script manually on the vast.ai machine to test something, and now `git pull` won't overwrite your local changes.

On the remote machine, just run:

```bash
git checkout -- scripts/vast.ai/start-group-moirai.sh
git pull
```

That discards local changes to that one file and then pulls the latest.
