[2026-04-04T05:43:34Z] [CLAUDE] Fixed all four statistics pages. The issue was that `react-day-picker` v9 with `numberOfMonths={2}` and `captionLayout="dropdown"` enforces consecutive months internally — when you use the dropdown to pick a month on one side, it auto-shifts the other side to maintain that constraint.

The fix replaces the single two-month `Calendar` with two independent single-month `Calendar` components (same pattern already used in `sales/analyse/page.tsx`). Each calendar controls its own displayed month independently via the dropdowns, so selecting months no longer causes unexpected shifting.
