[2026-04-05T12:22:25Z] [USER] Why does Toto inherit from Chronos2Direct?
[2026-04-05T12:22:31Z] [CLAUDE] Because they both use the same `chronos-forecasting` library and the same inference pattern — load a pipeline, call `pipeline.predict()`, get sample paths or quantiles, then apply Ridge regression on residuals. Toto Direct just overrides the model ID, precision, and capabilities but reuses all of Chronos2Direct's batch inference logic.
[2026-04-05T12:24:09Z] [USER] Toto is a completely different model I think. Another company, another model, other parameters
