- **"native"** — covariates passed as `feat_dynamic_real` columns in the GluonTS PandasDataset. The DataFrame is extended with future dates so MOIRAI-2's attention mechanism sees covariate values during decoding. `feat_dynamic_real_dim` is set to the actual feature count.

