[2026-04-06T10:32:28Z] [CLAUDE] Done. The script now auto-detects the system CUDA version via `nvcc --version` and installs the matching PyTorch nightly wheel (cu130, cu128, etc.) instead of hardcoding cu128. This way:

- On your CUDA 13.0 instance → installs `torch+cu130` → flash-attn builds without mismatch
