| `batch_size` | `8` | Outlets per forward pass |

Engine constants (not configurable): `PATCH_LEN=16`, `MAX_CONTEXT=2880`, `MAX_HORIZON=720`. Capabilities: multivariate, exogenous, uncertainty; supports daily/weekly/monthly frequencies; produces 9 quantiles (P10–P90).
