[2026-04-09T13:37:38Z] [CLAUDE] The data tells the story. Here's the comparison:

**Exploration (WPC only toggled):**
| | d_g1 | d_g2 | d_g3 | d_g4 | **Total** |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| WPC OFF | 971.10 | **-541.77** | -476.25 | 503.38 | **456.46** |
| WPC ON | 1011.64 | **-867.21** | -453.67 | 454.88 | **145.64** |

**Standalone simulations:**
| | d_g1 | d_g2 | d_g3 | d_g4 | **Total** |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| "All off" (0467a6e4) | 1051.32 | **-3050.02** | -1270.94 | 634.68 | **-2634.96** |
