[2026-04-09T13:58:39Z] [CLAUDE] The optimization schema defaults `delay` to **1**, while the standalone simulations were run with delay=14. That's the root cause of the discrepancy — the two methods are evaluating completely different scenarios (1-day-ahead vs 14-day-ahead prediction).

The exploration results aren't comparable to the standalone simulations because they're answering different questions: "which is better when predicting 1 day ahead?" vs "which is better when predicting 14 days ahead?"

For the tasks you mentioned:

