2) Can you put it on page sales/analyse; perhaps under the tab: Delivery Performance, or a new tab.
3) Instead of Outlet Group can you use the Outlet Info (key=route in this case) to make the accounts selection from.
4) In this instance, the accounts are in a route - which have some specific characteristics: one account follows another in a sequence. But this may not be the case for all account selections. So there should be an option where you can specify some characteristics of the outlet selection (e.g., route)
