## The verdict is about the route, not 7221

There's a single verdict for route 308, attached to that row in the cohort table. It says "this route's skips don't concentrate on the same outlets repeatedly" — not "outlet 7221 is OK." There's no per-outlet verdict.

## Why TCS didn't fire on route 308

TCS asks: *do the same outlets skip together, repeatedly?* Look at 7221's 15 skip Saturdays:

- **7/15 are solo** — only 7221 went dark that day (2024-11-23, 2024-12-21, 2025-01-11, 2025-02-22, 2025-03-15, 2025-05-10, 2025-11-08)
